+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KogfyG8AHHYRwfm7agMrzw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Phase 4: Delayed and Scheduled Tasks\n2\t\n3\tAdd the ability to defer tasks so they only become available for processing after a specified time.\n4\t\n5\t## Requirements\n6\t\n7\t- A task can be given a delay (in milliseconds) or a specific future time at which it becomes available.\n8\t- Delayed tasks are added to the queue immediately but are not returned when retrieving until their availability time has passed.\n9\t- Non-delayed tasks are always preferred over delayed tasks that are not yet available.\n10\t- When multiple delayed tasks become available simultaneously, they should be ordered by availability time, then priority, then FIFO.\n11\t- The task object should indicate when it becomes available.\n12\t- Delays work correctly with named queues.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9863f08a-9aa8-4f19-afb8-b8dc6c2021ba","uuid":"a7799d83-5cdb-4f48-997d-df097b4daef3","timestamp":"2026-05-31T00:40:54.902Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/phases/phase-04.md","content":"# Phase 4: Delayed and Scheduled Tasks\n\nAdd the ability to defer tasks so they only become available for processing after a specified time.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- A task can be given a delay (in milliseconds) or a specific future time at which it becomes available.\n- Delayed tasks are added to the queue immediately but are not returned when retrieving until their availability time has passed.\n- Non-delayed tasks are always preferred over delayed tasks that are not yet available.\n- When multiple delayed tasks become available simultaneously, they should be ordered by availability time, then priority, then FIFO.\n- The task object should indicate when it becomes available.\n- Delays work correctly with named queues.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
